Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime bootstrapper
https://developer.microsoft.com/microsoft-edge/webview2/

The installer carries Microsoft's bootstrapper, MicrosoftEdgeWebview2Setup.exe, signed by
Microsoft, and runs it only when the WebView2 Runtime is missing. The bootstrapper then downloads
the runtime from Microsoft. It is Microsoft's software under Microsoft's terms, which this file
doesn't cover.

